      "writtenOn": "2017-11-20T17:40:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I had looked at some other boards that were using isl charger chip. But, IIRC, none of them define a custom battery_is_present function, like we have on poppy/soraka/eve. So, in that case, charger state machine will only look for hardware gpio and decide whether to provide precharge current. So, ideally, I think those boards might not even run into this issue.",
